    {
      "source": "Default construct allowing for <a href=\"#setMarshaller(org.springframework.oxm.Marshaller)\"><code>setMarshaller(Marshaller)</code></a> and/or\n<a href=\"#setUnmarshaller(org.springframework.oxm.Unmarshaller)\"><code>setUnmarshaller(Unmarshaller)</code></a> to be invoked separately.",
      "translation": "默认构造函数，允许单独调用 <a href=\"#setMarshaller(org.springframework.oxm.Marshaller)\"><code>setMarshaller(Marshaller)</code></a> 和/或 <a href=\"#setUnmarshaller(org.springframework.oxm.Unmarshaller)\"><code>setUnmarshaller(Unmarshaller)</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"../../oxm/Marshaller.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.oxm\"><code>Marshaller</code></a> to be used by this message converter.",
      "translation": "设置<a href=\"../../oxm/Marshaller.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.oxm\"><code>Marshaller</code></a>供此消息转换器使用。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"../../oxm/Unmarshaller.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.oxm\"><code>Unmarshaller</code></a> to be used by this message converter.",
      "translation": "设置<a href=\"../../oxm/Unmarshaller.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.oxm\"><code>Unmarshaller</code></a>供此消息转换器使用。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "This converter requires a <code>Marshaller</code> and <code>Unmarshaller</code> before it can\nbe used. These can be injected by the <a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.oxm.Marshaller)\">constructor</a> or <a href=\"#setMarshaller(org.springframework.oxm.Marshaller)\">bean properties</a>.",
      "translation": "此转换器在使用之前需要一个 `<code>Marshaller</code>` 和一个 `<code>Unmarshaller</code>`。它们可以通过 `<a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.oxm.Marshaller)\">构造函数</a>` 或 `<a href=\"#setMarshaller(org.springframework.oxm.Marshaller)\">Bean 属性</a>` 进行注入。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that all <code>Marshaller</code> implementations in Spring also implement\n<code>Unmarshaller</code> so that you can safely use this constructor.",
      "translation": "注意，Spring 中的所有 `<code>Marshaller</code>` 实现也都实现了 `<code>Unmarshaller</code>`，因此您可以安全地使用此构造函数。",
      "count": 2
    },
